Package: spot-agent
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, sudo
Description: Spotledger host agent
 The Spotledger host agent runs as an unprivileged account and executes signed
 management commands. The few privileged operations go through a small helper
 named by an exact entry in /etc/sudoers.d/spot-agent.
 .
 The package never starts, enables or enrols the agent: enrolment is an
 explicit operator action with a one-time token.
